# End_to_End_project
############################################ Project_Structure #################################################################
############################################ Github Files ######################################################################
front-backend/
│
├── frontend/                         # React frontend
│   ├── public/                       # Static files
│   ├── src/                          # React source code
│   ├── .env                          # Frontend environment variables
│   ├── .gitignore                    # Git ignored files
│   ├── package.json                  # Node dependencies/scripts
│   └── package-lock.json             # Exact dependency versions
│
├── backend/                          # Go backend/API
│   ├── controller/                   # HTTP/API controllers
│   ├── model/                        # Database models
│   ├── repository/                   # Database operations
│   ├── routes/                       # API routes
│   ├── service/                      # Business logic
│   ├── go.mod                        # Go dependencies
│   ├── go.sum                        # Dependency checksums
│   └── main.go                       # Backend entry point
│
├── docker/
│   ├── frontend/
│   │   └── Dockerfile                # Frontend multi-stage image
│   └── backend/
│       └── Dockerfile                # Backend multi-stage image
│
├── k8s/
│   ├── namespace.yaml
│   │
│   ├── frontend/
│   │   ├── deployment.yaml
│   │   └── service.yaml
│   │
│   ├── backend/
│   │   ├── deployment.yaml
│   │   ├── service.yaml
│   │   ├── configmap.yaml
│   │   └── secret.yaml
│   │
│   ├── database/
│   │   ├── deployment.yaml
│   │   ├── service.yaml
│   │   └── pvc.yaml
│   │
│   └── ingress.yaml
│
├── terraform/
│   ├── provider.tf
│   ├── variables.tf
│   ├── outputs.tf
│   ├── vpc.tf
│   ├── eks.tf
│   ├── ecr.tf
│   ├── iam.tf
│   └── rds.tf
│
│
├── scripts/
│   ├── build.sh
│   ├── docker-build.sh
│   ├── ecr-push.sh
│   └── deploy.sh
│
├── Jenkinsfile
│
└── README.md

################################# Jenkins Pipeline Execution #########################################################

                    GitHub
                       |
                       ↓
                Clone Repository
                       |
             ┌─────────┴─────────┐
             ↓                   ↓
      Frontend Build       Backend Build
        npm ci                go mod
        npm build             go test
                             go build
             └─────────┬─────────┘
                       ↓
                Docker Build
             ┌─────────┴─────────┐
             ↓                   ↓
        Frontend Image      Backend Image
             └─────────┬─────────┘
                       ↓
                    ECR Login
                       ↓
                 Push to ECR
                       |
             ┌─────────┴─────────┐
             ↓                   ↓
        Frontend ECR        Backend ECR
             └─────────┬─────────┘
                       ↓
                Terraform Init
                       ↓
                Terraform Plan
                       ↓
               Terraform Apply
                       ↓
                     EKS
                       ↓
               kubectl apply
                       ↓
             ┌─────────┴─────────┐
             ↓                   ↓
       Frontend Pods        Backend Pods
             │                   │
             └─────────┬─────────┘
                       ↓
                    RDS
Verify Deployment



############################################# collect your credentials ################################

| Item                      | Where used        | Example                  | Your value                |
| ------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------- |
| GitHub username           | GitHub            | `Hemanthsrk`             | Already known             |
| GitHub repository         | Jenkins           | `front-backend`          | Already known             |
| GitHub branch             | Jenkins           | `min` or `main`          | **Confirm actual branch** |
| GitHub Jenkins credential | Jenkins           | `git`                    | Create                    |
| AWS Account ID            | ECR/Terraform     | `123456789012`           | **Your ID**               |
| AWS Region                | Terraform/Jenkins | `ap-south-1`             | `ap-south-1`              |
| AWS IAM credential        | Jenkins           | `aws-prod`               | Create                    |
| ECR frontend repo         | AWS               | `front-backend-frontend` | Create                    |
| ECR backend repo          | AWS               | `front-backend-backend`  | Create                    |
| EKS cluster               | AWS               | `front-backend-cluster`  | Create                    |
| RDS DB name               | RDS/K8s           | `employees`              | `employees`               |
| RDS username              | RDS/K8s           | `postgres`               | Choose                    |
| RDS password              | RDS/K8s           | `********`               | **Your password**         |
| RDS endpoint              | K8s               | `xxxx.rds.amazonaws.com` | Terraform creates         |
| Domain                    | Ingress/frontend  | `example.com`            | Optional                  |


